{
  "name": "Piercing Hand",
  "slug": "piercing-hand",
  "class": "Dragoneer",
  "subclass_feature": "Core Concept",
  "summary": "TBA",
  "introduction": [
    "The dragon’s eye archer, known as the piercing hand, is a duelist and ranged combatant who strikes surely at opponents with bestial ferocity and an eagle’s eye. They seize opportunities as an assassin might, but turn them to a vicious plunge meant to kill with each strike. As their skills reach their peak they gain the eye of the dragon, emulating their ability to see through illusions and deceptions without fail."
  ],
